; case: invalid-zero-clock-frequency
; expect: invalid-description
; why: A zero tick rate. F03: refused as a constraint error before any arithmetic divides by
;   it — and refused at the surface, so the description is ill-typed rather than merely
;   something a later stage would have to discover.
;
(eadl-version eadl/1)

(defblock timer.counter (offers (tick-rate 0 MHz)))
